+issueNumber: MDL-88618
+notes:
+  editor_tiny:
+    - message: >-
+        The TinyMCE Accordion (`accordion`) and List Styles (`advlist`) plugins
+        bundled with TinyMCE are now enabled. Accordion is available from the
+        Insert menu, and List Styles extends the existing bullet and numbered
+        list toolbar buttons with additional list styles.
+      type: improved
+  core:
+    - message: >-
+        The HTML Purifier configuration used by `purify_html()` now allows the
+        `details` (with the `open` attribute) and `summary` elements, as used
+        by the TinyMCE Accordion plugin.
+      type: improved
